JCcIhWYwsmx-AzbupaQ\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l2c-w9MQJGHnicSuNBmCrN9ISh5j4jkLgreoElrt8jaBvyWRsDv6S8AmSiwVAFyHzkCA2vRfuChNVPOaB4K_Ims\"]]],\"Tomb of the Mask: Old Maze\",[\"4.3\",4.3079],\"Action\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playgendary.tom\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.playgendary.tom\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.playgendary.tom\"]],[\"qgJeGlwICxIbChkKE2NvbS5wbGF5Z2VuZGFyeS50b20QARgDShMIpvuW8IOClQMVhpwKCR1ygClDmgETCLif5LmBgpUDFaG9CgkdtSkAxPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAA\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"yROmgQoH-Gw\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:yROmgQoH-Gw?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:yROmgQoH-Gw\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkWZKarPzYV8Eewe78JOjh0tujX-1LHvXwklul2XBkrUlepTe9RarZT4VaZpSI0tawLBQ08ZWour9B9RZyqjqxJKa-_hQcg-2rJ2-wrSqHqmQYrXeJgnuNj3k4nlIDzyvK4-sAdqJ7IVR3N5A2QWkrsDSahn79I5s6bGpvzhxgGLYbrehhH-NH7OE86cUKLOpwqPrlOyD3lEhX2LIW_FueDjG50Tn4ea9oG3PPYkal981WwiZM_bU2Aqwu80tT_9VB76UxT-xlbnzH9QlcAW9Bq77QcPGrwqSWHJXRhrg038U9KeP-4NejU_z8yqTE\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yROmgQoH-Gw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Tomb of the Mask is a fun game where you need to go through exciting mazes, successfully bypassing all the traps and escaping from the advancing lava! This game will appeal to everyone who likes old games, retro games and pixel games, as well as those who want to test their reflexes! Tomb of the Mask is an arcade game with vertical mazes and a variety of enemies and power-ups. At the beginning of the game, find a strange mask that will allow you to easily and quickly climb the walls, and go on a dynamic pixel adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY YOU WILL ENJOY PLAYING THIS GAME: \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOld games style\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game perfectly captures the spirit of retro games with its pixel art and classic 8 bit mazes! There is also a lot of harmonious geometry and verticality, which is typical of games of the past on slot machines.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChecking the reaction\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game will test your reflexes countless times. The endless maze, as befits maze games, is stuffed with all sorts of traps. In addition, enemies will be waiting for you, for example snakes, from which you need to have time to escape! And that\\u0026#39;s not all: all this time the lava will constantly rise, so you need to think and move quickly.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUseful power-ups\\u003cbr\\u003eTo successfully pass any trap in the maze, use power-ups! Shields protect against collisions, a magnet attracts all coins and dots, and freezing immobilizes enemies!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLots of powerful masks\\u003cbr\\u003eDiscover unique masks with special abilities! Put on your favorite powerful mask and use its characteristics, for example, get more coins or power-ups.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eALSO: \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFinally, these are very fun games! Fast, intense arcade gameplay, like the old games \\u0026quot;Snake\\u0026quot; and \\u0026quot;Pac Man\\u0026quot; (Pacman), will bring a lot of positive emotions! And you will definitely like the feeling that you were able to escape from the maze, try it yourself! But enough words, check out the famous game yourself and dive into a pixel retro adventure with The Mask! Hurry up and join us!\"],\"Playgendary Limited\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CTSl43iO0c7unv1vxMJ6YcDnxj1SLJHz0V-3s1DjdA18XzHc1j4MOAndGZYfPlZzXGu48g5fQRsLn3swMfI\"],null,[0,1,0,255]],null,[\"Everyone\",[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleuserco